      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1: build path\nTickets 01-20 done, including containment. Open: the first\nreal Build (ticket 10) and one check in ticket 12. Both\nneed the Operator present and the Build token. No real\nBuild has run yet.",
      "originalText": "Phase 1: build path\nTickets 01-20 done, including containment. Open: the first\nreal Build (ticket 10) and one check in ticket 12. Both\nneed the Operator present and the Build token. No real\nBuild has run yet.",
