      "text": "Phase 2: research\nAll tickets done except two: P2-14 (the 48h acceptance run)\nand P2-17 (PumpPortal market evidence, waits for P2-14).\nAlso shipped: Activity page, Atom feeds, new War Room look.\nProposals sort and filter is in progress.",
