      "text": "The 48h acceptance run\nLive, research only, API fallback off. It stopped once when\nthe laptop slept; it was restarted and now holds a sleep\nlock. Planned end 2026-11-08. Still to check: the\nforced-exhaustion fallback and card-to-launched. Usage so\nfar is roughly $0.3 to $0.9 of estimated plan usage per 6\nhours (not billed).",
      "originalText": "The 48h acceptance run\nLive, research only, API fallback off. It stopped once when\nthe laptop slept; it was restarted and now holds a sleep\nlock. Planned end 2026-11-08. Still to check: the\nforced-exhaustion fallback and card-to-launched. Usage so\nfar is roughly $0.3 to $0.9 of estimated plan usage per 6\nhours (not billed).",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-111",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
