      "updated": 1762500000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Waiting on the Operator\n1. Mint the Build token (blocks the first real Build).\n2. Confirm the workers.dev subdomain in Cloudflare.\n3. Check the claude.ai extra-usage setting.\n4. After the run: decide the API fallback and the research\nquota.\n5. Re-check that claude -p stays on the subscription.",
      "originalText": "Waiting on the Operator\n1. Mint the Build token (blocks the first real Build).\n2. Confirm the workers.dev subdomain in Cloudflare.\n3. Check the claude.ai extra-usage setting.\n4. After the run: decide the API fallback and the research\nquota.\n5. Re-check that claude -p stays on the subscription.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-115",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
